  "explain": "Ta có $\\dfrac{x-1}{x+3}=1-\\dfrac{4}{x+3}$.<br>$\\displaystyle\\int_1^2\\left(1-\\dfrac{4}{x+3}\\right)\\mathrm{d}x=\\Big[x-4\\ln|x+3|\\Big]_1^2=(2-4\\ln5)-(1-4\\ln4)=1+4\\ln\\dfrac45$.<br>Vậy $a=4,\\ b=5$, nên $2a+b=8+5=13$.",
