   "$\\sin \\left(\\Delta, (P)\\right)=\\dfrac{\\left|a\\cdot A+b\\cdot B+c\\cdot C\\right|}{\\sqrt{a^2+b^2+c^2}\\cdot \\sqrt{A^2+B^2+C^2}}$",
